  "title": "Cross-Method Framework for Multivariate Time Series Forecasting",
  "summary": "CrossRAG and TimeRFT propose novel approaches for forecasting based on retrieval-augmented methods and reinforcement learning. CrossRAG integrates Shape-Aware Memory (SAM) and Future-Consistent Contrastive (FCC) learning to enhance robustness, while TimeRFT introduces quality-aware reward mechanisms and difficulty-aware data selection for improved adaptation.",
